  "summary": "A flaw was found in the H.264 video parser in gst-plugins-bad. When processing a specially crafted H.264 video file or…",
  "details": "A flaw was found in the H.264 video parser in gst-plugins-bad. When processing a specially crafted H.264 video file or network stream with malformed Multiview (MVC) Sequence Parameter Set data, the parser can dereference a NULL pointer during the cleanup of partially allocated internal structures after a parse failure. This can cause the application using GStreamer to crash, resulting in a denial of service.",
